.cache/

# Google Service Keys — service account keys are secret, keep ignored
*google*key*.json*
*google*service-account*.json*
*kria-pocket-firebase-*.json*
google-services-key.json
*google-S-trykria.json*

# google-services.json is a public config file (safe to commit for EAS builds)
# It is NOT ignored — EAS cloud builds need it from git

# Memory folder - DO commit this
# /memory/  <- intentionally NOT ignored
